{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../", "title": "encryption"}], "prev": {"link": "../", "title": "encryption"}, "next": {"link": "../../auth_types/", "title": "auth_types"}, "title": "encryption.encrypt", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"module-encryption.encrypt\">\n<span id=\"encryption-encrypt\"></span><h1>encryption.encrypt<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-encryption.encrypt\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Import</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">auth0_server_python.encryption.encrypt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">decrypt</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">derive_encryption_key</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">encrypt</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.decrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">decrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">salt</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/encryption/encrypt.py#L58\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.decrypt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Decrypts the JWE token back to the original payload.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.derive_encryption_key\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">derive_encryption_key</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">salt</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#bytes\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/encryption/encrypt.py#L19\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.derive_encryption_key\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Derives a key using HKDF with SHA-256.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.encrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">encrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">payload</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">salt</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/encryption/encrypt.py#L31\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.encrypt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Encrypts the given payload into a JWE using the direct algorithm and A256CBC-HS512 encryption.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.ALG\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ALG</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'dir'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.ALG\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.BYTE_LENGTH\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BYTE_LENGTH</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">64</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.BYTE_LENGTH\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.DIGEST\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DIGEST</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.DIGEST\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.ENC\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ENC</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'A256CBC-HS512'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.ENC\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.ENCRYPTION_INFO\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ENCRYPTION_INFO</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">b'Auth0</span> <span class=\"pre\">Generated</span> <span class=\"pre\">Encryption'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.ENCRYPTION_INFO\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth_types/index", "auth_types", "N", "next"], ["reference/encryption/index", "encryption", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/encryption/encrypt/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">encryption.encrypt</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.decrypt\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">decrypt()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.derive_encryption_key\"><code class=\"docutils literal no